  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Enlightened scholars are proficient with club, crossbow (light or heavy), dagger, handaxe, javelin, kama, nunchaku, quarterstaff, sai, shortspear, short sword, shuriken, siangham, sling, and spear.They are not proficient with armor or shields.</p>\n<p>When wearing armor, using a shield, or carrying a medium or heavy load, an enlightened scholar loses his AC bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enlightened-scholar#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
